      "value": "<p>The chocobo knight can drive opponents back without giving ground. As a full-round action, the chocobo knight can make a single attack at his highest attack bonus. If the attack hits, the attack does damage as normal, and the chocobo knight may attempt a bull rush against the target. The chocobo knight gains a bonus on the bull rush combat maneuver check equal to half the amount of damage dealt on the initial attack.</p>",
